      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe that the public group instance update was the worst update ever made and that it only served the purpose of community segregation, instead of the power to kick or expel the instance being left to the vote of the majority of users as it always was, the power started to be delivered by anyone who has \"moderation\" in a certain small group, which destroyed the entire democratic issue that guaranteed a minimum of justice when expelling someone, especially because the user blocking system already exists to resolve individual problems. , expulsion from the public session should be something that is only given in extreme cases where the player is actually disturbing multiple people!!!",
